stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Created
  Created --> PendingPayment: enrolment submitted
  PendingPayment --> ActivePaid: verified payment success
  PendingPayment --> PaymentFailed: provider failure
  PaymentFailed --> PendingPayment: authorised retry
  PaymentFailed --> Cancelled: learner/admin cancels
  ActivePaid --> InProgress: first lesson started
  InProgress --> Completed: all required lessons complete
  ActivePaid --> Cancelled: approved cancellation before progress
  InProgress --> Refunded: authorised refund/withdrawal
  ActivePaid --> Refunded: authorised refund
  Completed --> Refunded: policy-approved post-completion refund
  Cancelled --> [*]
  Refunded --> [*]
  Completed --> [*]
  note right of Completed
    Course completion is separate
    from certificate issuance.
    Certificate service checks
    quiz pass and approved rules.
  end note